<view class="container confirm-page safe-bottom"><view class="page-title">需要确认标准答案</view><view class="confirm-intro">系统发现标准答案与题目匹配存在不确定性。确认后将继续批改。</view><view class="card confirmation-card"><view wx:if="{{confirmationItems.length}}"><view wx:for="{{confirmationItems}}" wx:key="sourceKey" class="confirmation-item"><view class="confirmation-item-head"><text class="confirmation-type">{{item.type}}</text><text class="confirmation-key">{{item.sourceKey}}</text></view><view class="confirmation-label">实际冲突原因</view><view class="confirmation-value">{{item.reason}}</view><view class="confirmation-label">系统识别到的答案</view><view class="confirmation-value">{{item.recognizedAnswer || '系统未返回可用答案'}}</view><view class="confirmation-label">建议操作</view><view class="confirmation-value">{{item.suggestion}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="confirmation-fallback">系统未能稳定识别标准答案，请输入正确答案或上传清晰的答案图片。</view></view><view class="card answer-card"><view class="section-title">补充或修正答案</view><textarea class="answer-textarea" value="{{manualAnswer}}" bindinput="set" placeholder="请输入正确的标准答案" maxlength="-1"/><view class="answer-image-head"><text>答案图片</text><text class="muted">可选，最多3张</text></view><view wx:if="{{existingAnswerImages.length || answerPaths.length}}" class="answer-image-grid"><view wx:for="{{existingAnswerImages}}" wx:key="fileId" class="answer-image-item"><image wx:if="{{item.tempUrl}}" src="{{item.tempUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" data-url="{{item.tempUrl}}" bindtap="previewOld"/><view wx:else class="image-unavailable">图片不可预览</view><text class="image-delete" data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="removeOld">删除</text></view><view wx:for="{{answerPaths}}" wx:key="*this" class="answer-image-item"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" data-url="{{item}}" bindtap="previewNew"/><text class="image-delete" data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="removeNew">删除</text></view></view><button class="secondary-button add-answer-image" bindtap="add">添加或重新上传答案图片</button></view><view class="fixed-action"><button class="primary-button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading || !canSubmit}}" bindtap="submit">确认答案并继续批改</button></view></view>
<privacy-dialog id="privacyDialog"/>
